Laptop.DeveloperLaptopmacOSAppleSilicon.DockerDesktopVM.k3dclusteragentic.namespacedefault.Deploymentcustomeragent.CustomerAgent_1 --> Laptop.DeveloperLaptopmacOSAppleSilicon.DockerDesktopVM.k3dclusteragentic.namespacedefault.Deploymentcustomeragent.OrdersStore_1 <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "lookup_order(order_id)\n<size:16>[SQLite read]</size>"
